New-Item `
    -ItemType Directory `
    -Force `
    -Path 'C:\projects\windows-jar-service'

Set-Location `
    'C:\projects\windows-jar-service'



dotnet new sln `
    --name 'JarServiceManager'



echo "# windows-jar-service" >> README.md
git init
git add README.md
git commit -m "first commit"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/suzdalenko-dev/windows-jar-service.git
git push -u origin main


2. Qué representa la solución

dotnet new sln `
    --name 'JarServiceManager'



Paso 4: crear el código compartido

dotnet new classlib `
    --name 'JarServiceManager.Core' `
    --output '.\src\JarServiceManager.Core' `
    --framework 'net10.0'


Paso 5: crear el servicio de Windows

dotnet new worker `
    --name 'JarServiceManager.ServiceHost' `
    --output '.\src\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost' `
    --framework 'net10.0'

Paso 6: crear la aplicación con ventana

dotnet new wpf `
    --name 'JarServiceManager.Desktop' `
    --output '.\src\JarServiceManager.Desktop' `
    --framework 'net10.0'


Paso 7: añadir los proyectos a la solución

dotnet sln '.\JarServiceManager.slnx' add `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.Core\JarServiceManager.Core.csproj' `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost.csproj' `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.Desktop\JarServiceManager.Desktop.csproj'

Compruébalo: tengo que tener 3 proyectos:

dotnet sln '.\JarServiceManager.slnx' list


Proyectos
---------
src\JarServiceManager.Core\JarServiceManager.Core.csproj
src\JarServiceManager.Desktop\JarServiceManager.Desktop.csproj
src\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost.csproj


Paso 8: conectar los proyectos

dotnet add `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost.csproj' `
    reference `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.Core\JarServiceManager.Core.csproj'


dotnet add `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.Desktop\JarServiceManager.Desktop.csproj' `
    reference `
    '.\src\JarServiceManager.Core\JarServiceManager.Core.csproj'


Paso 9: compilar todo

dotnet build `
    '.\JarServiceManager.slnx' `
    --configuration Release

    Restauración completada (1,7s)
      JarServiceManager.Core net10.0 realizado correctamente (7,5s) → src\JarServiceManager.Core\bin\Release\net10.0\JarServiceManager.Core.dll
      JarServiceManager.ServiceHost net10.0 realizado correctamente (1,9s) → src\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost\bin\Release\net10.0\JarServiceManager.ServiceHost.dll
      JarServiceManager.Desktop net10.0-windows realizado correctamente (2,5s) → src\JarServiceManager.Desktop\bin\Release\net10.0-windows\JarServiceManager.Desktop.dll


Paso 10: abrir la primera ventana

dotnet run `
    --project '.\src\JarServiceManager.Desktop\JarServiceManager.Desktop.csproj'


dotnet sln '.\JarServiceManager.slnx' list
dotnet build '.\JarServiceManager.slnx' --configuration Release